        },
        {
          "text": "O mwana amuntu, imba lwiimbo lwakulizya Farao mwami wa-Egepita. Umwaambile kuti, Wayeeya kuti, Ndime mulavu akati kabamasi. Anukuti uli mbuli intale yamumaanzi. Ulasotoka mumilonga yako, ulavundaanya maanzi azituta zyako akusofwaazya milonga yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
