        {
          "text": "Lino nenzoosaala nyika ya-Egepita kuti ibe matongo, nenzoosaala nyika azintu zyoonse mulinjiyo, nenzoouma bantu boonse bakede mulinjiyo, bayooziba kuti ndime Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
